        "answer": "He can play the guitar",
        "options": [
          "He can play the guitar",
          "He can plays the guitar",
          "He cans play the guitar"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "grammar_test_004",
    "title": "现在进行时",
    "level": "A1",
    "category": "时态",
    "explanation": "现在进行时表示正在进行的动作，结构为 be + 动词 ing。",
    "rules": [
      "am/is/are + doing",
      "时间词：now, at the moment",
      "疑问否定由 be 承担"
    ],
    "examples": [
      {
        "en": "I am reading a book now.",
        "zh": "我正在读书。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They are playing outside.",
        "zh": "他们正在外面玩。"
      }
    ],
    "exercises": [
      {
