        "question": "找出错误：He is run in the park.",
        "answer": "He is running in the park",
        "options": [
          "He is running in the park",
          "He is run in the park",
          "He running in the park"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "grammar_test_005",
    "title": "一般过去时（规则动词）",
    "level": "A1",
    "category": "时态",
    "explanation": "一般过去时表示过去的动作，规则动词过去式通常是动词加 ed。",
    "rules": [
      "动词 + ed",
      "时间词：yesterday, last week",
      "be 过去式：was / were"
    ],
    "examples": [
      {
        "en": "I visited my grandma yesterday.",
        "zh": "我昨天去看望了奶奶。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She played the piano last night.",
        "zh": "她昨晚弹了钢琴。"
      }
    ],
    "exercises": [
